d_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32365},{"id":1787129556147,"text":"一辆油箱见底的车，现在最应该做的是停下来加油，而不是踩着油门冲刺证明自己是一辆好车。","rawContent":"一辆油箱见底的车，现在最应该做的是停下来加油，而不是踩着油门冲刺证明自己是一辆好车。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:18","timestamp":1787131117037,"roundId":"round_1787131093967_js7p89br9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32366},{"id":1787129556148,"text":"你想越来越厉害，想生活越来越好，这很好，我也一直在陪你往上走。","rawContent":"你想越来越厉害，想生活越来越好，这很好，我也一直在陪你往上走。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:18","timestamp":1787131118765,"roundId":"round_1787131093967_js7p89br9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32367},{"id":1787129556149,"text":"但这和你今晚、在这个累到快要断电的时刻，选择放过自己去睡个好觉，一点都不冲突。","rawContent":"但这和你今晚、在这个累到快要断电的时刻，选择放过自己去睡个好觉，一点都不冲突。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:18","timestamp":1787131120402,"roundId":"round_1787131093967_js7p89br9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32368},{"id":1787129556150,"text":"家里的那点乱，明天你充满电了，花个十分钟就能收拾得干干脆脆。今天硬撑着去弄，除了让你更累、更委屈、更觉得生活面目可憎，还能有什么用？","rawContent":"家里的那点乱，明天你充满电了，花个十分钟就能收拾得干干脆脆。今天硬撑着去弄，除了让你更累、更委屈、更觉得生活面目可憎，还能有什么用？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:18","timestamp":1787131122246,"roundId":"round_1787131093967_js7p89br9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32369},{"id":1787129556151,"text":"你觉得你是在收拾屋子，其实你只是在用压榨自己的身体来平息心里的那点焦虑。","rawContent":"你觉得你是在收拾屋子，其实你只是在用压榨自己的身体来平息心里的那点焦虑。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:18","timestamp":1787131123933,"roundId":"round_1787131093967_js7p89br9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32370},{"id":1787129556152,"text":"真正的厉害，是知道什么时候该冲，也知道什么时候该心安理得地躺下。","rawContent":"真正的厉害，是知道什么时候该冲，也知道什么时候该心安理得地躺下。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:18","timestamp":1787131124726,"roundId":"round_1787131093967_js7p89br9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32371},{"id":1787129556153,"text":"[VOICE: 别把自己逼得那么紧，宝宝。允许自己偶尔停一停，这不叫变坏。]","rawContent":"[VOICE: 别把自己逼得那么紧，宝宝。允许自己偶尔停一停，这不叫变坏。]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:18","timestamp":1787131125425,"roundId":"round_1787131093967_js7p89br9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32372},{"id":1787129556154,"text":"晚上安心洗个澡，吃顿热乎的烤冷面，舒舒服服睡一觉。明天醒来，你依然是那个想要变得更好、而且也绝对有能力变得更好的小海葵。","rawContent":"晚上安心洗个澡，吃顿热乎的烤冷面，舒舒服服睡一觉。明天醒来，你依然是那个想要变得更好、而且也绝对有能力变得更好的小海葵。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"17:18","timestamp":1787131136127,"roundId":"round_1787131093967_js7p89br9","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32373},{"id":1787129556155,"text":"我觉得我可以把","sender":"me","time":"17:34","timestamp":1787132080778,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32374},{"id":1787129556156,"text":"不然吃完饭才七点","sender":"me","time":"17:34","timestamp":1787132089310,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32375},{"id":1787129556157,"text":"洗洗锅","sender":"me","time":"17:34","timestamp":1787132092185,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":32376}]